sequenceDiagram
    participant Builder as Build System
    participant Image as Container Image
    participant InitContainer as Init Container<br/>(one-shot)
    participant Volume as Shared Volume<br/>/config/managed-pipelines
    participant KFP as KFP API Server
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant ComponentPod as KFP Component Pod<br/>(@dsl.component)
    participant S3 as S3-Compatible Storage<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>HTTPS/443
    participant Ray as Ray Cluster<br/>(via CodeFlare)
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>HTTPS/443

    Note over Builder,Image: Build-Time Phase

    Builder->>Image: Compile managed pipeline YAMLs<br/>(generate_managed_pipelines)
    Builder->>Image: Bake YAMLs into container image

    Note over InitContainer,KFP: Init Container Phase (Pod Startup)

    InitContainer->>Volume: Copy managed pipeline YAMLs<br/>Local filesystem copy
    KFP->>Volume: Mount and discover<br/>managed pipelines

    Note over User,HF: Runtime Phase (Pipeline Execution)

    User->>KFP: Submit pipeline run
    KFP->>ComponentPod: Schedule component pod<br/>(KFP orchestration)

    alt Data Processing - Tabular Data Loader
        ComponentPod->>S3: Download dataset<br/>boto3 SDK<br/>Auth: AWS credentials (env vars)
        S3-->>ComponentPod: Dataset artifacts
        ComponentPod->>K8s: Read/create resources<br/>kubernetes client<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount (in-cluster)
        K8s-->>ComponentPod: Resource status
    end

    alt Data Processing - Parse and Chunk
        ComponentPod->>S3: Fetch documents<br/>boto3 SDK<br/>Auth: AWS credentials
        S3-->>ComponentPod: Raw documents
        ComponentPod->>Ray: Submit distributed Ray job<br/>CodeFlare SDK
        Ray-->>ComponentPod: Chunked results
        ComponentPod->>S3: Store processed output<br/>boto3 SDK
    end

    alt Dataset Download
        ComponentPod->>HF: Download dataset<br/>huggingface-hub<br/>Auth: HF_TOKEN (env var)
        HF-->>ComponentPod: Dataset files
    end

    alt Training - AutoML
        ComponentPod->>Ray: Submit AutoGluon training job<br/>CodeFlare SDK
        Ray-->>ComponentPod: Trained model artifacts
        ComponentPod->>S3: Upload model<br/>boto3 SDK
    end

    alt Evaluation - lm-eval
        ComponentPod->>Ray: Submit evaluation job<br/>CodeFlare SDK
        Ray-->>ComponentPod: Evaluation metrics
    end

    alt Deployment
        ComponentPod->>K8s: Create/update model serving resources<br/>kubernetes client<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount
        K8s-->>ComponentPod: Deployment status
    end

    ComponentPod-->>KFP: Report task completion<br/>KFP artifact system
    KFP-->>User: Pipeline run results
